  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (PS/55/2014/A received 24/09/2014) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 0800 to 1800 on Mondays to Friday and 0800 to 1300 on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays.",
    "Condition : 4 - Before the development is first occupied, a timber refuse storage enclosure, with a hinged and openable lid, of close-boarded or horizontal 'hit and miss' boarding construction, 1.3 metres high, 1.6 metres wide and 80 cm deep to house a wheeled refuse bin and other Council issued recycling containers shall be installed where shown on the approved plan PS/55/2014/A received 24/09/2014",
    "Condition : 5 - The wall dividing the two parking areas in the front drive area shall not exceed 0.6m in height at any point. The parking spaces shall be permanently retained.",
    "Condition : 6 - Prior to commencement of the works, details of the forecourt landscaping shall be submitted and approved by the Local Planning Authority."
